\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. COME, Thou everlasting Spirit,
\par Bring to every thankful mind
\par All the Saviour's dying merit,
\par All His sufferings for mankind:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. True recorder of His passion,
\par Now the living faith impart,
\par Now reveal His great salvation,
\par Preach His gospel to our heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Come, Thou Witness of His dying;
\par Come, Remembrancer divine,
\par Let us feel Thy power, applying
\par Christ to every soul, and mine.
\par                           Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

